    <briefdescription>
<para>Production-ready HNSW default parameters. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides optimized default parameters based on:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Dataset size</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Vector dimensionality</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Target recall vs latency trade-off</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Hardware capabilities</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Workload type (OLTP, Analytics, Mixed, RAG)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Based on:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>HNSW paper (Malkov &amp; Yashunin, 2018)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>ThemisDB benchmark results (BENCHMARK_RESULTS_COMPLETE_2025.md)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Production deployments and A/B testing</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>PERFORMANCE_TIPS.md workload optimization guidelines </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
